\begin{defn}
An abstract logic $\tuple{L, \models_L}$ has the \emph{Compactness
  Property} if each set $\Gamma$ of $L(\Lang{L})$-!!{sentence}s is
satisfiable whenever each finite $\Gamma_0 \subseteq \Gamma$ is
satisfiable.
\end{defn}

target:
